    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Multiplayer Physic based Robbery Game</h2><br>Your best buddy got you a job that will really test your nerves and morals! <br><br>You have one night to steal ALL YOU CAN TAKE from a bunch of different locations.  <br>Fill up your buddy's van and watch out, you might wake up the house owner or the security guard - so don't get caught!!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999450/extras/ce65b243a032a9185d1ba2431015dd91.poster.avif?t=1709733218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999450/extras/ce65b243a032a9185d1ba2431015dd91.webm?t=1709733218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999450/extras/ce65b243a032a9185d1ba2431015dd91.mp4?t=1709733218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levels</h2><br>Different locations will test your robbery skills! <br>Some level require more platforming - others more puzzle solving.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999450/extras/6a1212782f2b31361068f0811e78ffd3.avif?t=1709733218\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play with friends!</h2><br>Invite your friend and play all levels cooperatively with up to four players.<br>All levels are suitable for single player and multiplayer.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999450/extras/1f2fb1c369a80ef001a8b38a2b2dcc0d.avif?t=1709733218\" /></div>",
